    narr:narration """This narrative hub centers on the strategic positioning of the product as a [structured async decision platform](narr:Position_ProductCategoryAsyncPlatform), explicitly defined as an alternative to [real-time chat tools](narr:Position_AntiPatternRealtimeChat). The initial vision, established in March 2026, targets [remote teams of 10-50 people](narr:Position_TargetMarketRemoteTeams) who experience significant decision-loss. While the foundational [pricing was set at $12/user/month](narr:Position_PricingTwelveDollars), the trajectory shows a shift toward tiered complexity, with a March 2026 retro introducing a $15/user price point for larger teams. By August 2026, the focus moved toward validating this model through performance metrics, as seen in the [Sprint 4 success framing](narr:Position_Sprint4SuccessEvidenceFrame), which highlights [team velocity](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786441387536_2) as a primary indicator of operational health.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786441387536_2> ;
